AID
\f1\b0\fs30 \cb1 \

\f2\i\fs32 \cb3 Documentation lookup helper adding the aid method to the String class.
\f1\i0 \cb1 \
\
\cb3 AID is a SuperCollider documentation lookup helper that adds the aid method to the String class. It provides a fast and intuitive way to look up help files, browse URLs, and open local files directly from string literals. This makes it ideal for SuperCollider novices, occasional users, and those exploring third-party Quarks. \
It is syntactic sugar for the following methods:\cb1 \
\cb3     \'95   HelpBrowser: *goTo\cb1 \
\cb3     \'95   String: -help\cb1 \
\cb3     \'95   String: -openOS\
\cb1 \
\
\cb3 Classes, methods, titles, and summaries work in the same way as\'a0String: -help:\
\cb1 \

\itap1\trowd \taflags1 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrt\brdrnil \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrt\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf4 \clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf4 \clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf4 \clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf4 \clpadl100 \clpadr100 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\sl360\slmult1\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 // Classes:\cb1 \
\cb3 "Quark".aid;\cb1 \
\cb3 "Quark".help;\cb1 \
\
\cb3 // Methods:\cb1 \
\cb3 "help".aid;\cb1 \
\cb3 "help".help;\cb1 \
\
\cb3 // Titles:\cb1 \
\cb3 "Using Quarks".aid;\cb1 \
\cb3 "Using Quarks".help;\cb1 \
\
\cb3 // Summaries:\cb1 \
\cb3 "Object for managing a Quark - a package of source code".aid;\cb1 \
\cb3 "Object for managing a Quark - a package of source code".help;\cb1 \cell \lastrow\row
\pard\pardeftab720\sl360\slmult1\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
\
\cb3 Online documentation, web addresses, and local files (such as SCD, HTML, or any other format handled by the OS default application) can also be accessed directly:\
\cb1 \

\itap1\trowd \taflags1 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrt\brdrnil \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrt\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf4 \clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf4 \clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf4 \clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf4 \clpadl100 \clpadr100 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\sl360\slmult1\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 // Online documentation and web addresses:\cb1 \
\cb3 "https://github.com/supercollider-quarks/quarks".aid;\cb1 \
\
\cb3 // Local HTML files:\cb1 \
\cb3 (SCDoc.helpTargetDir +/+ "Guides/AID.html").aid;\
(SCDoc.helpTargetDir +/+ "help.html").aid;\cb1 \
\
\cb3 // Local files (opens in the OS default application):\cb1 \
\cb3 (Quarks.folder +/+ "AID/AID.scd").aid; // Local SCD files\
(Quarks.folder +/+ "AID/Classes/extString.sc").aid  // Local SC files\
(Quarks.folder +/+ "AID/README.rtf").aid; // Local RTF files\
\
// Local SCD files without path:\
"test.scd".aid // "test.scd".resolveRelative.openDocument\
\
// Quark folders (opens in the HelpBrowser for easy access to various help documents):\
(Quarks.folder +/+ "AID").aid;\cb1 \cell \lastrow\row
\pard\pardeftab720\sl360\slmult1\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
\
